#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:415
msgid "Connect the iPhone/iPad and the PC to the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Sambungkan iPhone/iPad dan PC ke Wi-Fi yang sama."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:416
msgid "On the iPhone/iPad, open Control Center: swipe down from the top-right corner of the screen."
msgstr "Di iPhone/iPad, buka Pusat Kontrol: usap ke bawah dari pojok kanan atas layar."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:417
msgid "Tap Screen Mirroring (the two stacked rectangles)."
msgstr "Ketuk Pencerminan Layar (ikon dua kotak bertumpuk)."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:418
msgid "Pick ZenLinkStudio. The screen shows up here."
msgstr "Pilih ZenLinkStudio. Layarnya muncul di sini."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:419
msgid "Press Start below."
msgstr "Tekan Mulai di bawah."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:425
msgid "First time only: plug in the USB cable, then press Set up Wi-Fi in Settings › Connection & driver."
msgstr "Pertama kali saja: colok kabel USB, lalu tekan Atur Wi-Fi di Pengaturan › Koneksi & driver."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:426
msgid "Unlock the iPhone/iPad, then press Start."
msgstr "Buka kunci iPhone/iPad, lalu tekan Mulai."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:427
msgid "Plug the iPhone/iPad into the PC with a USB cable."
msgstr "Colok iPhone/iPad ke PC pakai kabel USB."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:428
msgid "Unlock its screen."
msgstr "Buka kunci layarnya."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:429
msgid "If it asks \"Trust this computer?\", tap Trust and enter the passcode."
msgstr "Kalau muncul \"Percayai komputer ini?\", ketuk Percayai lalu masukkan kode sandi."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:434
msgid "Needs Trust"
msgstr "Perlu Trust"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:435
msgid "Wi-Fi not set up"
msgstr "Wi-Fi belum siap"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:436
msgid "Choose a mode"
msgstr "Pilih mode"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:437
msgid "Needs a driver"
msgstr "Perlu driver"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:438
msgid "Restore the Apple driver"
msgstr "Kembalikan driver Apple"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:439
msgid "Install the ZenLink Studio driver"
msgstr "Pasang driver ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:440
msgid "libusb-win32 is not installed"
msgstr "libusb-win32 belum terpasang"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:441
msgid "Remove the libusb0 filter first"
msgstr "Hapus filter libusb0 dulu"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:442
msgid "Choose a connection mode"
msgstr "Pilih mode koneksi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:443
msgid "Wi-Fi is not set up yet"
msgstr "Wi-Fi belum diatur"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:444
msgid "Unlock it and tap Trust"
msgstr "Buka kunci dan tekan Percayai"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:445
msgid "This device uses the ZenLink Studio driver, so Apple mode cannot see it. Restore the Apple driver, or switch to ZenLink Studio."
msgstr "Perangkat ini memakai driver ZenLink Studio, jadi mode Apple tidak bisa melihatnya. Kembalikan driver Apple, atau ganti ke mode ZenLink Studio."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:446
msgid "ZenLink Studio uses the libusb0 driver on the device. Install it, or switch to Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "ZenLink Studio memakai driver libusb0 di perangkat. Pasang drivernya, atau ganti ke mode Apple Driver."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:447
msgid "Install the iOS driver of TikTok LIVE Studio or libusb-win32 once, then press Check drivers. Or use Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "Pasang driver iOS TikTok LIVE Studio atau libusb-win32 sekali, lalu tekan Periksa driver. Atau pakai mode Apple Driver."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:448
msgid "A libusb0 filter is stacked on the Apple driver. It can crash Windows."
msgstr "Filter libusb0 menumpuk di driver Apple. Ini bisa membuat Windows crash."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:449
msgid "Pick Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio to continue."
msgstr "Pilih Apple Driver atau ZenLink Studio untuk lanjut."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:450
msgid "Plug in the cable once, then press Set up Wi-Fi in Settings. Or choose Cable."
msgstr "Colokkan kabel sekali, lalu tekan Atur Wi-Fi di Pengaturan. Atau pilih Kabel."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:451
msgid "Unlock the device, tap Trust if it asks, then try again."
msgstr "Buka kunci perangkat, tekan Percayai (Trust) kalau muncul, lalu coba lagi."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:453
msgid "Detect device"
msgstr "Deteksi perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:453
msgid "Found on USB through the libusb0 driver"
msgstr "Ditemukan di USB lewat driver libusb0"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:454
msgid "Open the device"
msgstr "Buka perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:454
msgid "Switching it to its screen-capture mode"
msgstr "Mengalihkan ke mode tangkap layar"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:455
msgid "Check trust"
msgstr "Cek kepercayaan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:455
msgid "Keep it unlocked while ZenLink proves this PC is trusted"
msgstr "Biarkan tidak terkunci sementara ZenLink membuktikan PC ini dipercaya"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:456
msgid "Start stream"
msgstr "Mulai stream"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:456
msgid "Receiving the screen over ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "Menerima layar lewat ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:458
msgid "Device connected"
msgstr "Perangkat tersambung"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:458
msgid "Your iPhone/iPad chose ZenLinkStudio in Screen Mirroring"
msgstr "iPhone/iPad memilih ZenLinkStudio di Pencerminan Layar"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:459
msgid "Secure connection"
msgstr "Koneksi aman"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:459
msgid "AirPlay pairing and FairPlay key exchange"
msgstr "Pairing AirPlay dan pertukaran kunci FairPlay"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:460
msgid "Receive video"
msgstr "Terima video"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:460
msgid "Decrypting the AirPlay stream"
msgstr "Mendekripsi stream AirPlay"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:461
msgid "Receiving the screen over Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Menerima layar lewat Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:463
msgid "Found through Apple Mobile Device Service"
msgstr "Ditemukan lewat Apple Mobile Device Service"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:464
msgid "Opening an encrypted Wi-Fi tunnel to the device"
msgstr "Membuka tunnel Wi-Fi terenkripsi ke perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:464
msgid "Opening an encrypted USB tunnel to the device"
msgstr "Membuka tunnel USB terenkripsi ke perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:465
msgid "Prepare the device"
msgstr "Siapkan perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:465
msgid "Keep it unlocked. The first time, a small developer image is installed."
msgstr "Biarkan tidak terkunci. Pertama kali, image developer kecil dipasang."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:466
msgid "Receiving the screen in HEVC"
msgstr "Menerima layar dalam HEVC"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:523
msgid "Ready · Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Siap · Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:528
msgid "Waiting for the iPhone / iPad"
msgstr "Menunggu iPhone / iPad"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:529
msgid "Plug in an iPhone or iPad"
msgstr "Colokkan iPhone atau iPad"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:529
msgid "{device} ready"
msgstr "{device} siap"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:538
msgid "Unlock it, then press Start mirroring."
msgstr "Buka kunci, lalu tekan Mulai mirroring."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:561
msgid "Windows Firewall blocks ZenLink, so the iPhone/iPad cannot connect. Press the button below, then choose Yes."
msgstr "Windows Firewall memblokir ZenLink, jadi iPhone/iPad tidak bisa tersambung. Tekan tombol di bawah, lalu pilih Ya."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:568
msgid "Allow ZenLink on the network"
msgstr "Izinkan ZenLink di jaringan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:640
msgid "Change"
msgstr "Ganti"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:641
msgid "Choose Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "Pilih Apple Driver atau ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:648
msgid "Cable (USB)"
msgstr "Kabel (USB)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:655
msgid "Stop waiting"
msgstr "Berhenti menunggu"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:663
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Coba lagi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:667
msgid "Restore Apple driver"
msgstr "Kembalikan driver Apple"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:668
msgid "Install driver"
msgstr "Pasang driver"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:669
msgid "Remove filter"
msgstr "Hapus filter"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:670
msgid "Choose mode"
msgstr "Pilih mode"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:671
msgid "Open settings"
msgstr "Buka pengaturan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:694
msgid "Couldn't connect"
msgstr "Tidak bisa tersambung"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:695
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Tersambung"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:696
msgid "Connecting to {device}"
msgstr "Menyambungkan ke {device}"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:697
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr "Menyambungkan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:732
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:894
msgid "Close ZenLink?"
msgstr "Tutup ZenLink?"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:897
msgid "ZenLink can keep running in the system tray so your devices stay connected."
msgstr "ZenLink bisa tetap berjalan di system tray agar perangkat tetap terhubung."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:907
msgid "Remember my choice"
msgstr "Ingat pilihan saya"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:926
msgid "You can change this in Settings."
msgstr "Bisa diubah di Pengaturan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:932
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:934
msgid "Quit ZenLink"
msgstr "Keluar dari ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:935
msgid "Minimize to tray"
msgstr "Kecilkan ke tray"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:985
msgid "How should ZenLink connect?"
msgstr "ZenLink mau tersambung lewat apa?"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:986
msgid "Nothing connects and no driver changes until you continue."
msgstr "Belum ada yang tersambung dan driver tidak diubah sampai kamu lanjut."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1006
msgid "Standard · full control"
msgstr "Standar · kontrol penuh"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1007
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Disarankan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1008
msgid "Uses Apple's own driver. Most compatible, stable and easy."
msgstr "Pakai driver bawaan Apple. Paling kompatibel, stabil dan gampang."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1010
msgid "Up to 60 fps, HEVC (device-limited bitrate, about 4–6 Mbps)"
msgstr "Sampai 60 fps, HEVC (bitrate dibatasi perangkat, sekitar 4–6 Mbps)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1011
msgid "Mouse touch, keyboard, gestures and buttons"
msgstr "Sentuh pakai mouse, keyboard, gestur dan tombol"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1012
msgid "Apple's own driver, nothing to install"
msgstr "Driver Apple sendiri, tidak perlu pasang apa-apa"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1013
msgid "Cable or Wi-Fi (after a one-time setup with the cable)"
msgstr "Kabel atau Wi-Fi (setelah setup sekali pakai kabel)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1014
msgid "iOS 17–26: Hybrid Control (experimental)"
msgstr "iOS 17–26: Hybrid Control (eksperimental)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1015
msgid "iOS 16 or older: use ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "iOS 16 ke bawah: pakai ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1024
msgid "For live streaming"
msgstr "Untuk live streaming"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1025
msgid "Best quality for streaming: high bitrate (measured 12–30 Mbps), up to 60 fps, very low latency. Needs the libusb0 driver."
msgstr "Kualitas terbaik untuk streaming: bitrate tinggi (terukur 12–30 Mbps), sampai 60 fps, latensi sangat rendah. Butuh driver libusb0."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1027
msgid "Up to 60 fps, full native resolution over the cable, high-bitrate H.264"
msgstr "Sampai 60 fps, resolusi native penuh lewat kabel, H.264 bitrate tinggi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1028
msgid "Cable (USB) or Wi-Fi (AirPlay, no driver)"
msgstr "Kabel (USB) atau Wi-Fi (AirPlay, tanpa driver)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1029
msgid "Picture and sound only: no touch, keyboard or gestures"
msgstr "Gambar dan suara saja: tanpa sentuh, keyboard, gestur"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1030
msgid "Apple apps can't see the device until you switch back"
msgstr "Aplikasi Apple tidak melihat perangkat sampai balik ke Apple Driver"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1037
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Sambungan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1041
msgid "Cable"
msgstr "Kabel"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1052
msgid "You can change it any time in Settings › Connection & driver. Changing it may need an app restart and reconnecting the cable."
msgstr "Bisa diganti kapan saja di Pengaturan › Koneksi & driver. Ganti mode bisa perlu restart app dan colok ulang kabel."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1059
msgid "Change device type"
msgstr "Ganti jenis perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1066
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Lanjut"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1185
msgid "Detected"
msgstr "Terdeteksi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1186
msgid " detected"
msgstr " terdeteksi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1187
msgid "Mirror and control compatible Apple devices using USB or Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Mirroring dan kontrol perangkat Apple lewat USB atau Wi-Fi."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1188
msgid "Android Smartphone / Tablet"
msgstr "Smartphone / Tablet Android"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1189
msgid "High-performance Android mirroring and control over USB or Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Mirroring dan kontrol Android berperforma tinggi lewat USB atau Wi-Fi."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1191
msgid "Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "Apple Driver atau ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1192
msgid "Cable or Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Kabel atau Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1195
msgid "Through ADB and scrcpy, no app on the phone"
msgstr "Lewat ADB dan scrcpy, tanpa aplikasi di HP"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1196
msgid "Cable or Wi-Fi, any Android brand"
msgstr "Kabel atau Wi-Fi, semua merek Android"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1231
msgid "Welcome to ZenLink"
msgstr "Selamat datang di ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1234
msgid "Which device would you like to connect?"
msgstr "Perangkat apa yang ingin kamu sambungkan?"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1305
msgid "Apple and Android devices are both connected. Choose the one to mirror."
msgstr "Perangkat Apple dan Android sama-sama tersambung. Pilih yang ingin dicerminkan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1312
msgid "Remember device type"
msgstr "Ingat jenis perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1316
msgid "You can change it any time in Settings › Device type or with the Back button."
msgstr "Bisa diganti kapan saja lewat Pengaturan › Jenis perangkat atau tombol Kembali."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1427
msgid "Android video"
msgstr "Video Android"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1431
msgid "A profile fills in resolution, FPS, bitrate and codec; change one value and the profile becomes Custom. Each phone keeps its own settings (the same over USB and Wi-Fi). Encoders are read from the phone on the first mirroring; if the chosen encoder fails, ZenLink tries another hardware encoder, then H.264, at most 4 times, and keeps your choice."
msgstr "Profile mengisi resolusi, FPS, bitrate dan codec; ubah satu nilai dan profile jadi Custom. Setiap HP menyimpan pengaturannya sendiri (USB dan Wi-Fi sama). Encoder dibaca dari HP saat mirroring pertama; kalau encoder pilihan gagal, ZenLink mencoba encoder hardware lain lalu H.264, paling banyak 4 kali, dan pilihanmu tetap disimpan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1439
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1439
msgid "Longest side."
msgstr "Sisi terpanjang."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1446
msgid "A cap; the phone never goes above its refresh rate."
msgstr "Batas atas; HP tidak melebihi refresh rate layarnya."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1465
msgid "H.265 needs HEVC Video Extensions on Windows."
msgstr "H.265 butuh HEVC Video Extensions di Windows."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1466
msgid "This phone has no H.265 encoder."
msgstr "HP ini tidak punya encoder H.265."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1467
msgid "Auto = H.264, the lowest latency."
msgstr "Auto = H.264, latency paling rendah."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1477
msgid "Detected on the first mirroring."
msgstr "Terdeteksi saat mirroring pertama."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1486
msgid "In use"
msgstr "Sedang dipakai"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1515
msgid "Already on the cable? Press the Wi-Fi button next to the phone's name, done. Without a cable (Android 11+):"
msgstr "Sudah pakai kabel? Tekan tombol Wi-Fi di samping nama HP, selesai. Tanpa kabel (Android 11+):"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1522
msgid "Option 1 · Scan a QR code (easiest)"
msgstr "Cara 1 · Pindai QR (paling mudah)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1523
msgid "The phone and the PC are on the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr "HP dan PC tersambung ke Wi-Fi yang sama."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1524
msgid "On the phone: Settings › Developer options › Wireless debugging › turn it on."
msgstr "Di HP: Pengaturan › Opsi pengembang › Debugging nirkabel (Wireless debugging) › aktifkan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1525
msgid "Press the button below, then on the phone tap \"Pair device with QR code\" and scan."
msgstr "Tekan tombol di bawah, lalu di HP ketuk \"Sambungkan perangkat dengan kode QR\" dan pindai."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1531
msgid "Show QR code"
msgstr "Tampilkan QR"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1533
msgid "Show a QR code to scan on the phone"
msgstr "Tampilkan QR untuk dipindai di HP"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1557
msgid "On the phone: Wireless debugging › \"Pair device with QR code\", then scan this code."
msgstr "Di HP: Debugging nirkabel › \"Sambungkan perangkat dengan kode QR\", lalu pindai kode ini."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1583
msgid "Option 2 · Pairing code or IP address"
msgstr "Cara 2 · Kode pairing atau alamat IP"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1585
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Tutup"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1585
msgid "Show"
msgstr "Buka"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1591
msgid "In Wireless debugging, tap \"Pair device with pairing code\"."
msgstr "Di Debugging nirkabel, ketuk \"Sambungkan perangkat dengan kode penyambungan\"."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1592
msgid "Enter the IP:port and the 6-digit code shown in that window, press Pair."
msgstr "Isi alamat IP:port dan kode 6 digit yang tampil di jendela itu, tekan Pair."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1593
msgid "Enter the IP:port from the main Wireless debugging screen (a different port), press Connect. Paired before? Go straight to step 3."
msgstr "Isi alamat IP:port dari layar utama Debugging nirkabel (port-nya beda), tekan Sambung. Sudah pernah pairing? Langsung langkah 3."

