#. added by hand
msgid "Administrator permission was not given. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Izin administrator tidak diberikan. Tidak ada yang diubah."

#. added by hand
msgid "The device was disconnected. Plug it back in and try again."
msgstr "Perangkat terputus. Colok lagi, lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Another app is using the device's screen (Xcode, QuickTime, TikTok LIVE Studio). Close it and try again."
msgstr "Aplikasi lain sedang memakai layar perangkat (Xcode, QuickTime, TikTok LIVE Studio). Tutup dulu, lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Unlock the device and tap Trust, then try again."
msgstr "Buka kunci perangkat dan tekan Percayai (Trust), lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Connect the device with the cable, unlock it and tap Trust first."
msgstr "Colokkan perangkat pakai kabel, buka kunci, lalu tekan Percayai (Trust) dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "Wi-Fi is already set up."
msgstr "Wi-Fi sudah siap. Bisa tanpa kabel."

#. added by hand
msgid "Wi-Fi needs Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "Wi-Fi butuh mode Apple Driver."

#. added by hand
msgid "Stop casting first."
msgstr "Hentikan mirroring dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "The iPhone or iPad is in a phone or video call. End the call, then try again."
msgstr "iPhone/iPad sedang dalam panggilan (telepon atau video call). Akhiri panggilan dulu, lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Choose a connection mode first."
msgstr "Pilih mode koneksi dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "Connect an iPhone or iPad with a USB cable."
msgstr "Colokkan iPhone atau iPad pakai kabel USB."

#. added by hand
msgid "This device uses the ZenLink Studio driver, so Apple mode can't see it. Press Restore Apple driver in Settings > Connection & Drivers, or switch to ZenLink Studio."
msgstr "Perangkat ini memakai driver ZenLink Studio, jadi mode Apple tidak bisa melihatnya. Tekan Kembalikan driver Apple di Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, atau ganti ke ZenLink Studio."

#. added by hand
msgid "ZenLink Studio needs its driver on this device. Press Install ZenLink Studio driver in Settings > Connection & Drivers, or switch to Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "ZenLink Studio butuh drivernya di perangkat ini. Tekan Pasang driver ZenLink Studio di Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, atau ganti ke mode Apple Driver."

#. added by hand
msgid "A libusb0 filter is stacked on Apple's driver. Press Remove libusb0 filter in Settings > Connection & Drivers first."
msgstr "Filter libusb0 menumpuk di driver Apple. Tekan Hapus filter libusb0 di Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "The ZenLink Studio driver is installed, but Windows hasn't attached it to the device yet. Unplug the cable and plug it in again (restart Windows if that doesn't help)."
msgstr "Driver ZenLink Studio sudah terpasang, tapi Windows belum memakainya untuk perangkat ini. Cabut lalu colok lagi kabelnya (restart Windows kalau belum berhasil)."

#. added by hand
msgid "The USB Direct driver isn't installed for this device yet. Open Settings > Connection & Drivers and press Install USB Direct driver, then reconnect the cable."
msgstr "Driver ZenLink Studio belum terpasang di perangkat ini. Buka Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, tekan Pasang driver ZenLink Studio, lalu colok ulang kabelnya."

#. added by hand
msgid "Another driver change is running."
msgstr "Penggantian driver lain sedang berjalan."

#. added by hand
msgid "The device isn't on Wi-Fi yet. Press Set up Wi-Fi in Settings with the cable connected, keep both on the same network, or switch to Wired."
msgstr "Perangkat belum tersambung Wi-Fi. Tekan Atur Wi-Fi saat kabel tersambung, pastikan di jaringan yang sama, atau pilih Kabel."

